---
import PillarLayout from '../../layouts/PillarLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<PillarLayout slug="hydronic-radiant">

  <section class="section bg-sand-2" style="padding:clamp(40px,5vw,64px) 0">
    <div class="container pillar-detail__wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow"><Icon name="flame" size={15} /> A Hoffmeyer specialty</span>
      <h2>Radiant comfort, balanced end to end</h2>
      <div class="pillar-detail__body">
        <p>In-floor hydronic heat is one of the most comfortable ways to warm a home, and it is a real specialty of the shop. We design and install the tubing, manifolds, and controls using Rehau, Uponor, and Heat Link components, and we integrate the whole system with a high-efficiency boiler so it runs balanced.</p>
        <p>Radiant is at its best in basements, bathrooms, garages, and open main floors where forced air struggles, and it pairs well with lower water temperatures that high-efficiency boilers are built for. For a new build or a renovation, it is worth designing in from the start.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="pillar-detail__bullets" style="background:var(--sand)">
        <li><Icon name="check" size={16} /> Tubing, manifold, and control design and install</li>
        <li><Icon name="check" size={16} /> Balanced with a high-efficiency boiler</li>
        <li><Icon name="check" size={16} /> Service on existing radiant systems</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

</PillarLayout>
